Subject: [PATCH 160/228] cpufreq: imx6q: Convert to light weight ->target_index() routine
Date: Fri, 13 Sep 2013 18:31:46 +0530
Message-Id: <da00e886fa9dbcd316edc893e0235e42d76c791e.1379063063.git.viresh.kumar@linaro.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.12.rc2.18.g61b472e
